<p><strong>Core commitments</strong></p>

<p>🛡️ <strong>CBAM diagnostic data is never uploaded</strong> — The HS codes, export volumes, and other diagnostic data you enter in the CBAM tool are stored only in your browser (localStorage) and never uploaded to our servers. Only you can see this data.</p>

<p>🛡️ <strong>AI literacy assessment data is never uploaded</strong> — Your answers and results in the AI literacy assessment are likewise stored only in your browser (localStorage) and never uploaded to our servers.</p>

<p>🤝 <strong>We never share your personal information</strong> — We do not sell, trade, or transfer your personal information to any third party, including discussions within the "AI Era Survival Guide" on Knowledge Planet, except with your explicit consent or as required by law.</p>

<p><strong>Key terms at a glance</strong></p>

<ul>

<li><strong>Information collected</strong>: Name, email, and company name you voluntarily provide (for lead generation); automatically recorded server access logs (for operations); Knowledge Planet nickname and activity (for community management).</li>

<li><strong>Data use</strong>: Used only to deliver the CBAM reports, AI literacy assessment reports, and AI Era Survival Guide materials you request, and to improve website service and community operations.</li>

<li><strong>Data retention</strong>: Server lead data retained for ≤ 12 months after your last interaction; browser localStorage expires automatically after 7 days; Knowledge Planet content retained per platform rules.</li>

<li><strong>Your rights</strong>: Access, correction, deletion, restriction of processing, data portability, and withdrawal of consent.</li>

<li><strong>Legal basis</strong>: Article 13 of China's Personal Information Protection Law (consent); Article 6 of the GDPR (consent).</li>

<li><strong>Contact</strong>: connie@humanaifit.com, responding within 72 hours.</li>

</li></ul>

